type: software
title: "astroCAMP: Astronomical Co-design Analysis and Metrics Platform"
abstract: >
  astroCAMP is a benchmarking framework and companion dataset for evaluating
  radio-interferometric imaging pipelines under performance, energy, scientific
  quality, and sustainability constraints, targeting SKA-scale workloads.
